4G/LTE Module
-------------

|Product| is equipped with a M.2 connector that can connect an optional 4G/LTE module. The customer will also need a SIM Card Holder and a 4G/LTE antenna connector to ensure 4G/LTE works. 

SIM card does **NOT** support hot plug. **Power off** before inserting or removing SIM card.

